{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fcefa189f3d94cb2","name":"Carnivorous Plants","source":{"id":"source:reference-fcefa189f3d94cb2","title":"Carnivorous Plants","revision":21286,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:30:24Z","sha256":"9d14793ab28b25a92f6eda7a4ece8e7dc7ccd6fa30f078778a8e307fc5186380","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21286","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Carnivorous%20Plants&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fcefa189f3d94cb2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["A large plant uses its vinelike tentacles to consume living creatures."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Beings that erect permanent installations in forests or jungles often place Carnivorous Plants along commonly used paths as natural guardians and as a first line of defense against interlopers. Some beings might even bring them indoors for extra security.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Carnivorous Plants Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being enters a square within 3 squares of a Carnivorous Plant.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +8 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the end of the target's turn, while the being remains within 3 squares of the Carnivorous Plant.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"h